    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly, i don't think i can just \"take a break.\" everything feels so heavy. it feels like there's no way back from this. people look at me and see this promising researcher, but behind that, there's just nothing. i'm just empty. like, what is the point of even trying to fix it or starting over when the version of me that actually had a future is just gone? it feels like the world just keeps moving and i'm just... finished.",
